---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Licensing | Macro Evidence"
  description="How Macro Evidence website source, visitor-facing text, official identity assets, and third-party material are licensed or governed."
>
  <div class="policy-page">
    <PageIntro
      kicker="Licensing"
      title="Open work has clear boundaries."
      lead="Different parts of this website are available under different terms. This page explains what each license covers and how official identity assets and third-party material are governed."
    />

    <section class="section">
      <div class="site-container reading policy-reading-wide">
        <section>
          <h2>Website source and software</h2>
          <p>
            The website's program/source code, CSS, build scripts, configuration, CI definitions, and repository
            implementation documentation are licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
          </p>
          <p><a class="text-link" href="/licenses/apache-2.0.txt">Read the Apache 2.0 license text →</a></p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Visitor-facing textual content</h2>
          <p>
            Unless specifically identified otherwise, the human-readable institutional prose rendered by the website
            is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0).
          </p>
          <p><a class="text-link" href="/licenses/cc-by-sa-4.0.txt">Read the CC BY-SA 4.0 license text →</a></p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Official identity assets</h2>
          <p>
            Macro Evidence marks, lockups, social identity artwork, and website identity icons are not included in
            either blanket license above. Their use is governed separately by the Trademarks Policy, the Brand assets
            guidance, and applicable law.
          </p>
          <div class="reference-links">
            <a class="text-link" href="/trademarks">Review trademark guidance →</a>
            <a class="text-link" href="/brand-assets">Review brand assets →</a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Third-party material</h2>
          <p>
            Third-party material remains subject to its applicable upstream license. The Inter webfont distributed by
            this site is licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL-1.1).
          </p>
          <div class="reference-links">
            <a class="text-link" href="/licenses/inter-OFL-1.1.txt">Read the Inter OFL text →</a>
            <a class="text-link" href="/licenses/inter-NOTICE.txt">Read the Inter attribution notice →</a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Repository-level detail</h2>
          <p>
            The website repository records the exact source/content boundary, brand asset exclusions, and third-party
            provenance for contributors and maintainers.
          </p>
          <p>
            <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/macro-evidence/website">
              View the website source and licensing records on GitHub →
            </a>
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
